# The quantbacktest wheel the API runs on (blueprint/wp/24-backtest.md, lot B8).
#
# The one place the pin lives: scripts/install_quantbacktest.sh reads it, and
# through that script so do web/Dockerfile.prod, api/Dockerfile,
# scripts/run_api.sh and the CI job `pytest`. api/tests/test_quantbacktest_pin.py
# fails when the installed wheel is not this commit.
#
# A commit, not a version: while the wheel is 0.x a signature may change without
# the version moving (~/quant-backtest/docs/contract.md, section 6). The version
# is only checked against what that commit declares.
#
# Bumping it is step 3 of the contract's section 2: quant-backtest first pins
# the quantModeling commit it prices with, then this file moves.
QUANTBACKTEST_REPO=https://github.com/HadrienT/quant-backtest.git
QUANTBACKTEST_SHA=2fa334e8993c91aa3b841ecbc266edee8b8f4202
QUANTBACKTEST_VERSION=0.1.0
